ref: spec | RFC 1546: Host Anycasting Service | Partridge, Mendez & Milliken, IETF, 1993 | https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc1546
ref: spec | RFC 7871: Client Subnet in DNS Queries | Contavalli et al., IETF, 2016 | https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7871
